# Golden files are compared byte for byte: never convert their line endings.
crates/ecad-file/tests/golden/*.ecad -text

# Lanes in flight add lines to these lists only (owner, 2026-11-13; see the files' comments).
# A union merge keeps both sides' added lines instead of a conflict; `cargo fmt` and the
# `lanes_are_in_brief_order` test catch the order. Only for files that lanes add lines to.
**/tests/all/lanes/mod.rs merge=union
crates/ecad-cadcraft/src/lanes.rs merge=union
